; The Cyclesim leg (AGENT.md 1d): doom.blob on the cycle-accurate HardCaml
; model. The oberon-risc-hardcaml submodule is its own dune project and stays
; PRISTINE — treat it as raw data; the risc5/ and nexys4/ wrapper dirs compile
; its sources into THIS project (the same copy_files pattern both repos use
; for the vendored emulator). Its own vendor/ (the nested emulator submodule,
; uninitialized) is never scanned, so nothing collides with the main
; workspace's `emu`.
;
; This root builds on the OxCaml switch (hardcaml v0.18-preview):
;   opam exec --switch=5.2.0+ox -- dune build --root sim

(executable
 (name doom_sim)
 (libraries hardcaml nexys4_board risc5 unix)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_hardcaml)))
